@startuml API-Gateway State Machine
!define CONDITION [condition]
!define EVENT event
!define RESPONSE / response

title API-Gateway (Spring Cloud Gateway)\nRequest Processing State Machine

[*] --> RequestReceived

state "RequestReceived" as RequestReceived
state "CORSCheck" as CORSCheck
state "LoggingRequest" as LogRequest
state "RouteMatching" as RouteMatch
state "CircuitBreakerCheck" as CBCheck
state "ForwardingToOrchestrator" as Forward
state "FallbackResponse" as Fallback
state "ReceivingResponse" as ReceiveResp
state "LoggingResponse" as LogResp
state "ResponseToClient" as Response
state "ErrorState" as Error

RequestReceived --> CORSCheck : HTTP request arrives\n/ CorsWebFilter invoked

CORSCheck --> LogRequest : Origin validation\n[origin in {localhost:5173,5174,3000,5175}]\n/ add CORS headers

CORSCheck --> Response : Origin validation\n[origin not allowed]\n/ return 403 Forbidden

LogRequest --> RouteMatch : Log request\n/ responseLogger.logRequest(method, path)\n[Order=-1, runs first]\n(LoggingFilter.java:41)

RouteMatch --> CBCheck : Path match\n[path == /api/v1/orchestrator/**]\n/ route to uri: http://orchestrator:8082\n(application.yml:29-32)

RouteMatch --> Response : No route match\n[no predicate matches]\n/ return 404 Not Found

state CBCheck {
  [*] --> EvaluateCircuit

  state "Evaluate\nCircuit State" as EvaluateCircuit
  state "CLOSED\n(healthy)" as CB_Closed
  state "HALF_OPEN\n(testing)" as CB_HalfOpen
  state "OPEN\n(fail fast)" as CB_Open

  EvaluateCircuit --> CB_Closed : Check Resilience4j\n[failureRate < 50% over 50 calls]\n[minimumCalls >= 10]\n(application.yml:52-57)

  EvaluateCircuit --> CB_HalfOpen : Check Resilience4j\n[waitDuration 10s elapsed]\n[testing recovery]

  EvaluateCircuit --> CB_Open : Check Resilience4j\n[failureRate >= 50%]\n[circuit tripped]

  CB_Closed --> [*]
  CB_HalfOpen --> [*]
  CB_Open --> [*]
}

CBCheck --> Forward : Circuit state: CLOSED\n/ forward request normally

CBCheck --> Forward : Circuit state: HALF_OPEN\n/ forward test request

CBCheck --> Fallback : Circuit state: OPEN\n/ invoke fallbackUri:\n/fallback/orchestrator\n(application.yml:42)

Forward --> ReceiveResp : Orchestrator responds\n[any status code 200/400/500]\n/ proxy response

Forward --> Error : Orchestrator timeout/error\n[connectTimeout > 5s ||\nresponseTimeout > 10s]\n/ connection failure

Fallback --> ReceiveResp : Generate fallback\n/ FallbackController.orchestratorFallback()\n/ return 503 JSON:\n{\n  "service": "orchestrator",\n  "status": "unavailable",\n  "error": "Service Unavailable",\n  "message": "temporarily unavailable",\n  "timestamp": ISO-8601\n}\n(FallbackController.java:30-42)

ReceiveResp --> LogResp : Response received\n/ status code available

LogResp --> Response : Log response\n/ responseLogger.logResponse(method, path, status)\n(LoggingFilter.java:48)

Error --> Response : Error occurred\n/ responseLogger.logError(method, path, error)\n/ return 500 or 503\n(LoggingFilter.java:45)

Response --> [*]

note right of RouteMatch
  DISABLED: Rate limiting is commented
  out in application.yml lines 34-38.
  RateLimitConfig exists but unused.
end note

note right of CBCheck
  Circuit Breaker Config:
  - Sliding window: 50 calls (COUNT_BASED)
  - Min calls: 10 (before calculating)
  - Failure threshold: 50%
  - Wait in open state: 10s

  application.yml:49-58
end note

note bottom of Fallback
  UNUSED: FallbackController has
  /fallback/scheduler endpoint but
  no matching route in application.yml.
  Future functionality.
end note

@enduml
